osition":{"commit_sha":"d24c9eb91cb7b246aeb3af86ccce9c82efb66cc0","position":"1787095226520972001-eb0f6457-e667-4f79-8ebe-18093ca77836"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"89c4dbe97b57f6ca6bbacdc40634d23664f8d185a1dae72707e5ced5959745fa","event_uuid":"5661d1f6-4e5a-4edb-bae0-448729d10dbd","position":{"commit_sha":"53d5d024c833de5dbeec20ed29e02e6de1e075c5","position":"1787095267050085001-5661d1f6-4e5a-4edb-bae0-448729d10dbd"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787095131772288001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0fa31637-4b25-45d6-935c-9b1438b007c7","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"6633-219e-988a-42f6"},{"link_uuid":"a56ff398-0fd7-4fae-bb55-2ec1827335f3","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"d074-ab22-e37a-4480"},{"link_uuid":"c63a34dd-3b9f-4af9-ab18-9ece254f22d8","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"9515-ffa1-5272-4310"},{"link_uuid":"70b44a48-4510-49cf-93a3-ffef7b73821e","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"1b07-bf4d-4aca-41c4"},{"link_uuid":"eb0f6457-e667-4f79-8ebe-18093ca77836","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"9e42-78f7-c164-4bc8"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nSlice C1 (ticket 29a9-3cf7-3ded-42d8) recorded 7 below-seam ambient config/credential reads in the residual scattered readers (_logging, _opcert_signing, _operation_config, mirror_guard, review_bot/app, signing) as entries in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS`. RP-04 is not complete while these ambient reads sit below the approved composition/credential/backend seams enforced by `scripts/check_config_ownership.py`. Parent: 075b-1479-dcb7-40ab.\n\nAffected files (relative to `src/rebar/`):\n  - `src/rebar/_logging.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_opcert_signing.py`\n  - `src/rebar/_operation_config.py`\n  - `src/rebar/mirror_guard.py`\n  - `src/rebar/review_bot/app.py`\n  - `src/rebar/signing.py`\n\nThis is the LAST subsystem slice: after it, the whole-tree `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` list in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py` reaches EMPTY. This slice asserts that end state and removes any residual legacy facade.\n\n## Outcome\nEvery below-seam read in the files above is either (a) CUT to compose through the approved seam that already assembles config — the operation snapshot (`rebar._operation_config.OperationSnapshot` / `compose_operation_snapshot`), a startup binding, or the provider-credential boundary — or (b) REGISTERED as an owned, non-legacy entry with an exact `path`+`symbol`+`rationale` for genuine test-only controls and protocol constants. Their `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries are removed. `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` reports zero findings for these paths with those entries gone and no path-glob exception. The subsystem's behavioral suites stay green; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded, justified deltas.\n\n## Plan\n1. For each below-seam read in the listed files, classify as cut-to-seam or register-owned; for cut-to-seam, thread the value from the composition seam rather than reading ambient `os.environ`/`os.getenv`/`load_config` below it.\n2. Remove the corresponding entries for these files from `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` in `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`.\n3. Run `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` and the subsystem behavioral suites (tests/unit signing/opcert/logging suites); keep green.\n\n## Testing (RED -> GREEN)\n- Held-out test `tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_seam_clean_heldout.py` asserts `check_config_ownership.check(check_config_ownership.REPO_ROOT)` returns no finding string containing any of the listed paths, AND that `config_ownership_exceptions.LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` contains zero entries whose `path` is one of the listed files. RED now (entries present + reads below seam).\n- The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/unit signing/opcert/logging suites) stay green after the cutover — they are the correctness oracle the AST gate supplements.\n- Redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints before/after are equal except recorded deltas.\n\n## Compatibility / rollback\nNo stored ticket/event/binding format changes. A legacy facade is removed only after its focused suite passes; until then rollback selects the facade.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] No direct ambient config/credential read, backend reload, or configurable default remains below the approved seam in the 6 listed files; each is cut-to-seam or registered as an owned (non-legacy) entry with rationale.\n- [ ] The `LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS` entries for these files are removed from `scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py`, and `python scripts/check_config_ownership.py` passes with no path-glob exception (proven by the held-out `test_residual_drain_seam_clean_heldout.py`).\n- [ ] The subsystem behavioral suites (tests/unit signing/opcert/logging suites) pass after the cutover; redacted operation-snapshot fingerprints / provider-neutral outcomes are unchanged except recorded approved deltas.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_logging.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_opcert_signing.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/_operation_config.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/mirror_guard.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/review_bot/app.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"src/rebar/signing.py","reason":"Cut below-seam config/credential read to the approved seam."},{"path":"scripts/config_ownership_exceptions.py","reason":"Remove C3f LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS entries as reads are cut to seam."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_seam_clean_heldout.py","reason":"Held-out proof: gate clean + zero legacy entries for these files."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","1b07-bf4d-4aca-41c4"],["depends_on","6633-219e-988a-42f6"],["depends_on","9515-ffa1-5272-4310"],["depends_on","9e42-78f7-c164-4bc8"],["depends_on","d074-ab22-e37a-4480"],["parent","075b-1479-dcb7-40ab"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"075b-1479-dcb7-40ab","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"ed65-a3d7-1aeb-4c36","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-04 S7.3.f — residual-drain cutover: route below-seam config reads through seams","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["49eaa49a-d688-4eeb-a3b5-acef613470a0","35671db0-60b2-454b-875f-aa38c29f94c2","0fa31637-4b25-45d6-935c-9b1438b007c7","a56ff398-0fd7-4fae-bb55-2ec1827335f3","c63a34dd-3b9f-4af9-ab18-9ece254f22d8","70b44a48-4510-49cf-93a3-ffef7b73821e","eb0f6457-e667-4f79-8ebe-18093ca77836","5661d1f6-4e5a-4edb-bae0-448729d10dbd"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787097956098698794,"uuid":"efe37fda-fbe9-48f0-b635-320b2f9ce666"}